  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed extension, by reason of its height and depth along the boundary with No.18,&amp;nbsp; would result in a substantial structure located on the boundary that has an overbearing impact and results in overshadowing and a loss of outlook for the occupiers at No.18. As such, the proposal would result in an unacceptable impact on the residential amenities of the occupiers of no.18 Bergholt Crescent and is contrary to policy D6 (Housing standards) of the London PLan (2021) and policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020), and Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2025).&lt;/p&gt;"
